WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
It was wrong, right? Sister Hu

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,880
He also specially brought Hua Qingxiang as a sword shield.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,920
What a capable boss

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,760
I'll make tea for you boss

5
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,040
I just spent a long time thinking about it at home

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,800
Auction on December 1st

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,040
Until now, I don’t even have a decent auction manual.

8
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,320
There is no customer information

9
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:18,880
I'm really panicking

10
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,880
This auction doesn’t need to be too rigid.

11
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,880
All items are my personal belongings

12
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,760
The main thing is the thousand-year life

13
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,360
and a few pieces of top-quality jadeite, bright and clear

14
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,460
The people who came here are all experts.

15
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,900
The real thing is more effective than any manual.

16
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,260
You are Uncle Jia, so don’t worry

17
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,820
But I am the hammer auctioneer.

18
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,100
What if I get cold feet in front of those multinational conglomerates?

19
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,940
It’s the Tianbao Auction House’s face that’s been lost.

20
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,980
The next public auction is being planned

21
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,420
Just treat it as water this time

22
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,680
I can trust your spiritual field reflection

23
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:49,210
Just go at your own pace, boss

24
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:51,290
Your villa is so big

25
00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:55,430
Can I go upstairs and visit? Go ahead.

26
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:57,070
Take a look on the second and third floors
